{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01089",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 0.98,
      "end_seconds": 2.85,
      "duration_seconds": 1.87,
      "text": "Evening. Let's get started."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 8.56,
      "end_seconds": 13.66,
      "duration_seconds": 5.1,
      "text": "Hi doctor, I got here as fast as I could."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 14.91,
      "end_seconds": 17.39,
      "duration_seconds": 2.48,
      "text": "How are things, what's been happening?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 18.37,
      "end_seconds": 29.22,
      "duration_seconds": 10.85,
      "text": "Honestly, it's sudden low back pain, and my family pushed me to come. I did try to ignore it for a while."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 31.23,
      "end_seconds": 34.68,
      "duration_seconds": 3.45,
      "text": "What's the timeline, when did it begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 36.59,
      "end_seconds": 40.5,
      "duration_seconds": 3.91,
      "text": "It's been about two weeks, I'm fairly sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 41.0,
      "end_seconds": 43.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.91,
      "text": "I follow. How frequently does it come?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 46.12,
      "end_seconds": 48.97,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "It's a few times a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 49.38,
      "end_seconds": 52.27,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "Hm, okay. Is it accompanied by anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 52.98,
      "end_seconds": 67.37,
      "duration_seconds": 14.39,
      "text": "Stiffness goes along with it, most of the time. The stiffness? That's been for ten days. And there's a twinge down the thigh as well, um, six months now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 67.88,
      "end_seconds": 74.39,
      "duration_seconds": 6.51,
      "text": "Have you had sudden low back pain before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 75.26,
      "end_seconds": 84.43,
      "duration_seconds": 9.17,
      "text": "Yes, something like this happened a couple of years ago, and it went away on its own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 85.55,
      "end_seconds": 90.78,
      "duration_seconds": 5.23,
      "text": "Have you noticed fever, leg weakness or numbness in the groin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 92.08,
      "end_seconds": 97.88,
      "duration_seconds": 5.8,
      "text": "No fever, leg weakness or numbness in the groin, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 99.82,
      "end_seconds": 102.73,
      "duration_seconds": 2.91,
      "text": "Have you had any bladder problems?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 104.59,
      "end_seconds": 108.04,
      "duration_seconds": 3.45,
      "text": "Not at all, no bladder problems."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 108.65,
      "end_seconds": 113.05,
      "duration_seconds": 4.4,
      "text": "Any change in your bowel habit or your stomach generally?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 113.98,
      "end_seconds": 115.58,
      "duration_seconds": 1.6,
      "text": "Nothing unusual, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 116.49,
      "end_seconds": 119.55,
      "duration_seconds": 3.06,
      "text": "Alright, have you got any known allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 122.74,
      "end_seconds": 127.06,
      "duration_seconds": 4.32,
      "text": "Wheat. I come out in... well, itchy skin."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 128.81,
      "end_seconds": 131.56,
      "duration_seconds": 2.75,
      "text": "Have you ever had an operation?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 132.12,
      "end_seconds": 136.47,
      "duration_seconds": 4.35,
      "text": "Yes, I had a triple bypass, eight years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 146.8,
      "end_seconds": 150.01,
      "duration_seconds": 3.21,
      "text": "Any health conditions I should have on record?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 151.08,
      "end_seconds": 169.5,
      "duration_seconds": 18.42,
      "text": "I've had arthritis in my knees, yes. I took the morning off to come in today. My family kept telling me to get it checked. I have heart disease. Sorry, I know I'm rambling a bit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 171.35,
      "end_seconds": 178.32,
      "duration_seconds": 6.97,
      "text": "Okay, do you take any prescribed or over-the-counter medicines? Take your time, there's no rush."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 181.87,
      "end_seconds": 192.83,
      "duration_seconds": 10.96,
      "text": "I take paracetamol, 650 milligrams, when needed for the knee pain. It's metoprolol, 50 milligrams, twice a day for my heart."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 197.21,
      "end_seconds": 200.51,
      "duration_seconds": 3.3,
      "text": "A few questions about your lifestyle now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 201.41,
      "end_seconds": 219.7,
      "duration_seconds": 18.29,
      "text": "I only drink at family occasions. I smoke roughly a pack every two days. My husband and I live above the shop. I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 221.5,
      "end_seconds": 224.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.62,
      "text": "Let's start with the basic checks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 236.45,
      "end_seconds": 239.07,
      "duration_seconds": 2.62,
      "text": "Bear with me while this finishes..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 253.93,
      "end_seconds": 261.92,
      "duration_seconds": 7.99,
      "text": "Okay: SpO2 99 percent on room air, BP is 124 over 74, heart rate 67, respiratory rate 18."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 263.28,
      "end_seconds": 264.63,
      "duration_seconds": 1.35,
      "text": "Is that normal?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 266.36,
      "end_seconds": 269.29,
      "duration_seconds": 2.93,
      "text": "I'll come back to the numbers."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 272.14,
      "end_seconds": 275.9,
      "duration_seconds": 3.76,
      "text": "Right, let's have a proper look at you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 277.54,
      "end_seconds": 280.71,
      "duration_seconds": 3.17,
      "text": "Stay as you are for a moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 293.69,
      "end_seconds": 300.73,
      "duration_seconds": 7.04,
      "text": "The muscles beside the spine are tight and tender and you can lift both legs fully."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 304.3,
      "end_seconds": 306.23,
      "duration_seconds": 1.93,
      "text": "Please sit back down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 314.17,
      "end_seconds": 326.96,
      "duration_seconds": 12.79,
      "text": "Okay, so my impression is this: It's hard to say. Mechanical low back pain is one possibility and a nerve irritation another, and I'd rather not commit yet."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 327.7,
      "end_seconds": 330.05,
      "duration_seconds": 2.35,
      "text": "Is this serious, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 332.0,
      "end_seconds": 346.5,
      "duration_seconds": 14.5,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like mechanical low back pain. What I'm giving you is naproxen, 500 milligrams, twice a day with food, five days. That's for back pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 347.02,
      "end_seconds": 348.12,
      "duration_seconds": 1.1,
      "text": "Mm, alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 352.61,
      "end_seconds": 376.43,
      "duration_seconds": 23.82,
      "text": "Keep moving and walk a little each day. Try to keep a simple diary of when it happens and what you were doing, and bring it to the next visit. Keep an eye out, and if you notice numbness in the groin or lose bladder control, call us the same day or go to emergency."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 377.47,
      "end_seconds": 380.79,
      "duration_seconds": 3.32,
      "text": "Okay, I'll look out for that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 386.58,
      "end_seconds": 395.14,
      "duration_seconds": 8.56,
      "text": "Let's plan a check if it is not better in two weeks. Okay, I think we're done unless you have questions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 397.84,
      "end_seconds": 401.11,
      "duration_seconds": 3.27,
      "text": "I think I understand everything. Thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 403.05,
      "end_seconds": 404.42,
      "duration_seconds": 1.37,
      "text": "See you soon."
    }
  ]
}